<section class="contact-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-page__header">
      <h1 class="contact-page__title">Print Corrections</h1>
      <p class="contact-page__desc">Changes after printing and guidance on AI-generated artwork.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-page__form-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2>Changes after your order has been printed</h2>
      <p>If your print needs to be changed after it has already been printed because you need to amend your supplied artwork, an <strong>£8 correction fee</strong> applies.</p>
      <p>Please contact us with your order number and details of the change before sending replacement artwork. We will confirm what needs to be done and any reprinting costs before proceeding.</p>
      <h2>AI-generated images</h2>
      <p>AI-generated images can sometimes be unpredictable. An image may look clear on a phone or computer screen but appear pixelated, blurry or show unexpected details when printed, especially at a larger size. This does not happen with every AI-generated image.</p>
      <p>Please check your artwork carefully at the intended print size before ordering. If you are unsure whether your image is suitable, contact us before we print it.</p>
      <p>If customer-supplied AI artwork needs to be changed after printing, the same <strong>£8 correction fee</strong> applies.</p>
      <h2>If there is a problem with your order</h2>
      <p>Please contact us so we can look into it. This correction fee does not limit your statutory rights where goods are faulty or not as described.</p>
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Contact Us About a Correction</a>
      {% render 'correction-purchase' %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Print corrections",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
